SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 5
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    Mn 1
    C(4) 0.5

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0 1
        -parms 10.0 1.0
        -steps 10 seconds in 100
        -cvode

USER_PUNCH
    -headings step SI_Aragonite
    -start
    10 PUNCH KIN_TIME/10
    20 PUNCH SI("Aragonite")
    -end

END
